@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Enter a Standard Giveaway - Lively Help Center";
    ViewData["CategorySlug"] = "Buying";
    ViewData["SubCategorySlug"] = "Buying items";
    ViewData["HeroTitle"] = "Enter a Standard Giveaway";
    ViewData["HeroStyle"] = "background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url('/help_centre_img/help_area/help_centre_hero_bg.png');";
    ViewData["IsArticle"] = true;
}

<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>Standard giveaways on Lively are free to enter (the seller pays for shipping) and give you a chance to win items during a live show.</p>

        <p>This article explains how to enter a standard giveaway. To learn about all giveaway types and how they work, visit <a asp-action="Index" asp-controller="Home">Giveaways Overview</a>.</p>

        <h2>How to enter a giveaway pinned in a livestream</h2>

        <p>When a seller runs a giveaway, the giveaway details appear at the bottom of the livestream. Check the details to make sure you qualify.</p>

        <p>When a seller starts a giveaway, it will be pinned to the livestream.</p>

        <p><strong>Note:</strong> You can only enter a giveaway using the Lively app (iOS or Android).</p>

        <p><strong>To enter:</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Open the Lively app on your mobile device.</li>
            <li>Go to the livestream you want to join.</li>
            <li>When the seller pins the giveaway, tap <strong>Enter Giveaway.</strong></li>
        </ol>

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
            <div class="helpful-buttons">
                <button type="button">Yes</button>
                <button type="button">No</button>
            </div>
            <span>80 out of 145 found this helpful</span>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>